{
  "lines": {
    "rosmarin_4_a": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. You walk quietly. The fairy ring noticed.",
    "rosmarin_4_b": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Take this seed. Plant it where the sun stays long, and bring the fruit to the old stone in the Secret Woods.",
    "rosmarin_2_a": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Catches the player at the fence, sets a test.",
    "rosmarin_2_b": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Do you have a moment?",
    "rosmarin_2_ans1": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Of course.",
    "rosmarin_2_ans2": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. I should be going, but go on.",
    "rosmarin_2_r1": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Thank you. That means a lot.",
    "rosmarin_2_r2": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Then I will be quick.",
    "rosmarin_2_c": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Here, I want you to have this.",
    "rosmarin_6_a": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Brews something, shows the tower room.",
